/* ==============================================================================================   DESKTOP SHELL
   Root cause of the "clumped / spread-out" desktop look: the phone bottom bar (a row of equal-width flex items) was
   turned into a vertical rail by turning its axis, but the items kept "flex:1", so each one stretched to a fifth of the
   screen height and the labels floated apart. Fix: items no longer grow, and from 1024px the rail is a real sidebar
   (icon + label side by side, ~248px) with the page and header laid out beside it. Phones (<900px) are untouched.
   ===================================================================================================== */
